<p>✅&nbsp;獨立使用洗衣機&nbsp;，洗好的衣物頂樓有曬衣間! </p><p>✅&nbsp;租金含網路 </p><p>✅提供短租服務！！最短一個月租期也可以喔!詳細請私訊洽談。（短租服務費另談）</p><p>✅&nbsp;帶看免費!簽約成交收取半個月服務費!&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "大同區民生西路", "lat": "25.0568099", "lng": "121.5087407", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "subway", "name": "迪化街站", "distance": 231, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約231公尺"}, {"type": "subway", "name": "延平一站(南京)", "distance": 424, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約424公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "民生西寧路口站", "distance": 57, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約57公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "長安新怡成香舖", "distance": 826, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約826公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "大稻埕涼麵店", "distance": 33, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約33公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "臺北市大同區永樂國民小學", "distance": 552, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約552公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "臺北市立忠孝國民中學", "distance": 621, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約621公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "16,000元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "租金含", "value": "網路", "key": "priceContainText"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "見使照", "key": "purpose", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "可使用面積", "value": "9坪", "key": "area", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "建物面積", "value": "見使照", "key": "buildArea", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "屋齡", "value": "-", "key": "age", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "電梯", "value": "無", "key": "lift", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "裝潢程度", "value": "中檔裝潢", "key": "decorate", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "裝潢時間", "value": "半年內", "key": "decorate_time", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "其他特色", "value": "近捷運、新上架、拎包入住